  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: "Yes, yes, \u201Ctrying your best.\u201D A classic backup strategy
    for people who burn water. But credit where it\u2019s due - at least you\u2019re
    admitting your limitations this time. Growth! Progress! Character development!
